<main id="main">
<section class="ihero"><div class="ihero-text"><div class="ihero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">Services</span></nav><p class="kicker">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services for Alaska Property Claims</h1><p class="lede">Twelve services, one goal: a valuation of your loss that holds up. Start with an estimate review, bring us in after appraisal is demanded, or appoint us as a neutral umpire.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line light" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div></div></div><figure class="ihero-photo"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-repair.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-repair-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-repair.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:900px) 100vw, 55vw" width="1200" height="896" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="pgrid" data-stagger><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/appraisal-panel-representation/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3v18M7 21h10M5 7h14M5 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0zM19 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0z"/></svg></span><h2>Appraisal Panel Representation</h2><p>We act as the appraiser you name once the appraisal clause has been invoked, from first inspection to signed award.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/home-insurance-claim-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-winter.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-winter-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-winter.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 10.5L12 3l9 7.5V21a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-7H9v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z"/></svg></span><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Independent valuation of disputed dwelling, other-structure and contents losses for Alaska homeowners and condo owners.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/commercial-hoa-condo-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="829" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M9 6h2M13 6h2M9 10h2M13 10h2M9 14h2M13 14h2M10 22v-4h4v4"/></svg></span><h2>Commercial, HOA &amp; Condo Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal and valuation support for businesses, landlords, condo associations and multifamily owners.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/roof-damage-claim-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/metal-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/metal-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/metal-roof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="918" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2 12L12 4l10 8M5 10v10h14V10"/><path d="M9 20v-6h6v6"/></svg></span><h2>Roof, Hail &amp; Ice Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Roof claim valuation for wind, ice, snow and the occasional hail event, including metal and low-slope roofs.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/windstorm-claim-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wind-tree.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wind-tree-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wind-tree.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M17.7 7.7A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 19.5 12H2M9.6 4.6A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2M12.6 19.4A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2"/></svg></span><h2>Windstorm Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Valuation of damage from downslope, gap and coastal winds, including roofs, siding, fences and fallen trees.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/snow-load-ice-dam-claims/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-collapse.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-collapse-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-collapse.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2v20M4.9 4.9l14.2 14.2M2 12h20M4.9 19.1L19.1 4.9M9 3l3 2 3-2M9 21l3-2 3 2M3 9l2 3-2 3M21 9l-2 3 2 3"/></svg></span><h2>Snow Load &amp; Ice Dam Claims</h2><p>Appraisal of roof collapse, framing deflection and interior water damage caused by heavy snow and ice dams.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/frozen-pipe-water-damage-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="1007" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5S5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"/></svg></span><h2>Frozen Pipe &amp; Water Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Valuation of water losses from freeze-ups, burst lines, boilers and appliance failures, including drying and mold.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/fire-smoke-ash-claim-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="797" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.4-.5-2-1-3-1.1-2.1-.2-4 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.2.4-2.3 1-3.4.4 1.4 1.4 2.4 2.5 2.4z"/></svg></span><h2>Fire, Smoke &amp; Wildfire Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal of structure fires, chimney and stove fires, and wildfire smoke and ash damage.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/earthquake-endorsement-claims/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/quake-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/quake-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/quake-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2 12h4l2-6 3 12 3-9 2 3h6"/></svg></span><h2>Earthquake Endorsement Claims</h2><p>Valuation support for owners who carry earthquake coverage and disagree with the carrier&#x27;s damage estimate.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/remote-property-claim-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/remote-cabin.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/remote-cabin-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/remote-cabin.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M17.8 19.2L16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.1-1.1.5l-.3.5c-.2.5-.1 1 .3 1.3L9 12l-2 3H4l-1 1 3 2 2 3 1-1v-3l3-2 3.5 5.3c.3.4.8.5 1.3.3l.5-.2c.4-.3.6-.7.5-1.2z"/></svg></span><h2>Remote &amp; Off-Road-System Properties</h2><p>Claim valuation for cabins, lodges and homes reached by plane, boat, barge or seasonal road.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg></span><h2>Carrier Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line review of the insurer&#x27;s estimate that shows what is missing, underpriced or miscalculated.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-practice/neutral-umpire-services/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation-laptop.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-laptop-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation-laptop.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-b"><span class="pcard-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h2>Neutral Umpire Services</h2><p>Impartial umpire work for appraisal panels that cannot agree, for policyholders and carriers alike.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faqsec"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker dark">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most claims begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone invokes appraisal, it helps to know where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. Many disputes close at that stage.</p><a class="btn dark" href="/appraisal-practice/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to invoke appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle both residential and commercial claims?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes: houses, condos, multifamily, retail, office, lodges, hangars and association properties.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you only handle storm claims?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. We work on wind, snow load, water, fire, earthquake (where covered) and other perils.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><div><p class="cta-h">Not sure the number is right?</p><p>Send us the carrier’s estimate and your photos. We’ll review them and give you a straight answer.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line light" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
